<title>USA: Atlantic Pharmaceuticals raises $12.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Pharmaceuticals raises $12.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday it raised gross proceeds of about $12.5 million through the private placement of equity securities.</p>
<p>The company said the offering, which was originally intended to raise $7.5 million, was increased to meet investor demand.</p>
<p>Atlantic said that 1.25 million shares of its Series A preferred stock were issued. Each share of Series A preferred stock is convertible into 2.12 shares of common stock at a conversion price of $4.72107, subject to adjustment, based on the prevailing market price for the common stock.</p>
<p>Atlantic is a biopharmaceutical company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
